# The All below filter.  With location OFF alone the search finds the
# items there (item 1); with All below it finds those of every location
# under it too (item 3 on Shelf A1, item 2 in Box B2), in the tree's
# order.
T ADMIN
K ENTER
T Retro1986
K ENTER
K CTRL-F
K TAB TAB TAB
T OFF
K TAB
S ALLOFF
K CTRL-S
S OFFONLY
K ESC SPACE
S ALLON
K CTRL-S
S BELOW
